# hackers.txt
# Information for security researchers and ethical hackers
{%- if site is defined and site.name_long is defined %}
# {{ site.name_long }}
{%- endif %}

# =============================================================================
# Welcome
# =============================================================================

{%- if hackers is defined and hackers.greeting is defined %}
{{ hackers.greeting }}
{%- else %}
Hello, hackers and security researchers!

We appreciate your interest in our security. If you've found a
vulnerability, please report it responsibly.
{%- endif %}

# =============================================================================
# Vulnerability Disclosure
# =============================================================================

{%- if hackers is defined and hackers.disclosure is defined %}
{{ hackers.disclosure }}
{%- else %}
We ask that you:
- Do not access or modify data that doesn't belong to you
- Do not disrupt our services or degrade user experience
- Report vulnerabilities to us privately first
- Give us reasonable time to address the issue
{%- endif %}

# =============================================================================
# Contact
# =============================================================================

{%- if hackers is defined and hackers.contact is defined %}
Security Contact: {{ hackers.contact }}
{%- elif site_contact is defined and site_contact.email is defined %}
Security Contact: {{ site_contact.email }}
{%- endif %}

{%- if site_contact is defined and site_contact.url is defined %}
Security Policy: {{ site_contact.url }}security.txt
{%- endif %}

# =============================================================================
# Scope
# =============================================================================

{%- if hackers is defined and hackers.in_scope is defined %}
In Scope:
{%- for item in hackers.in_scope %}
- {{ item }}
{%- endfor %}
{%- else %}
In Scope:
- *.{{ site_contact.url | default("example.com") | replace("https://", "") | replace("http://", "") | replace("/", "") | replace("www.", "") }}
{%- endif %}

{%- if hackers is defined and hackers.out_of_scope is defined %}

Out of Scope:
{%- for item in hackers.out_of_scope %}
- {{ item }}
{%- endfor %}
{%- else %}

Out of Scope:
- Social engineering attacks
- Physical security testing
- Third-party services
- Denial of service attacks
{%- endif %}

# =============================================================================
# Recognition
# =============================================================================

{%- if hackers is defined and hackers.rewards is defined %}
{{ hackers.rewards }}
{%- else %}
We may acknowledge security researchers who:
- Follow responsible disclosure guidelines
- Report valid, previously unknown vulnerabilities
- Help us improve our security posture

{%- if hackers is defined and hackers.hall_of_fame is defined %}
Hall of Fame: {{ hackers.hall_of_fame }}
{%- elif site_contact is defined and site_contact.url is defined %}
# Hall of Fame: {{ site_contact.url }}security/acknowledgments/
{%- endif %}
{%- endif %}

# Happy hacking!
